--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NOTE ON SCOPE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository contains design documents only. It ships no source code, and it
is not the normative Fomoxa Binary Protocol specification - that specification
lives in its own repository and is unaffected by anything described here.

Software implementations of fRPC are independent projects. Authors of such
implementations may choose any license for their software, provided they do not
misrepresent the origin of these documents or remove the required attribution
when redistributing the documents themselves.
